# following the scroll at the top (JS writes --earn-in over hero progress 0.58 -> 0.72; CSS uses it in the hero-pill state).
# Apply on the v8-best build (fixes/v8-best/patch.diff). Contains excerpts of Fastwork's code: local branches only, never push.
